1020
00:39:12,119 --> 00:39:13,219
(The pre-sorting process makes their job easier.)

1021
00:39:13,819 --> 00:39:15,649
- This one.
- I found a smaller one.

1022
00:39:15,649 --> 00:39:16,949
(He found one smaller sea squirt.)

1023
00:39:17,519 --> 00:39:19,259
You did a great job out at sea.

1024
00:39:19,419 --> 00:39:21,189
- So I gave you an easy task.
- Thank you.

1025
00:39:21,189 --> 00:39:22,189
This is so easy.

1026
00:39:22,929 --> 00:39:24,329
- Did you have fun?
- What should I do with this one?

1027
00:39:24,329 --> 00:39:26,199
- I had so much fun. Yes.
- Did you?

1028
00:39:26,429 --> 00:39:27,999
- Here.
- It was really fascinating.

1029
00:39:28,229 --> 00:39:29,699
When can I ever experience something like this?

1030
00:39:32,269 --> 00:39:35,669
(The second batch of sea squirts, weighing 1.8 tons, is added.)

1031
00:39:36,239 --> 00:39:39,309
(The entrance is packed with sea squirt customers.)

1032
00:39:39,979 --> 00:39:41,009
(The older members are busy welcoming the sea squirt customers.)

1033
00:39:41,009 --> 00:39:42,049
That's good.

1034
00:39:43,749 --> 00:39:45,449
Koreans always prioritize speed in their jobs.

1035
00:39:45,449 --> 00:39:46,449
- Right.
- Speed is important.

1036
00:39:46,449 --> 00:39:47,449
Hurry up.

1037
00:39:48,019 --> 00:39:50,389
(They pick up the pace to get it done quickly.)

1038
00:39:50,389 --> 00:39:51,489
Oh, my goodness.

1039
00:39:53,359 --> 00:39:54,489
(Separating)

1040
00:39:54,789 --> 00:39:56,029
(Separating)

1041
00:39:56,959 --> 00:39:58,929
(It's no problem for Captain Yum.)

1042
00:40:01,529 --> 00:40:04,029
(The sea squirt separating machine)

1043
00:40:12,079 --> 00:40:16,549
(The sea squirts are split quickly by Jung Ah's skillful hands.)

1044
00:40:17,079 --> 00:40:20,319
(Sun Young works hard to keep up with Jung Ah.)

1045
00:40:21,819 --> 00:40:22,819
(Groaning)

1046
00:40:22,819 --> 00:40:24,989
(Struggling)

1047
00:40:25,819 --> 00:40:27,319
(Struggling)

1048
00:40:28,019 --> 00:40:30,729
(It's harder to split sea squirts than expected.)

1049
00:40:32,429 --> 00:40:34,429
(Pulling hard)

1050
00:40:34,659 --> 00:40:36,099
Oh, boy. What should I do with this?

1051
00:40:36,099 --> 00:40:38,639
(Separating sea squirts is no joke.)

1052
00:40:38,639 --> 00:40:39,939
I can't split them.

1053
00:40:41,069 --> 00:40:42,109
My gosh. Here we go.

1054
00:40:42,639 --> 00:40:43,669
Hold on.

1055
00:40:43,669 --> 00:40:45,239
(She barely managed to split them.)

1056
00:40:46,179 --> 00:40:47,409
Oh, no. We have too many sea squirts...

1057
00:40:47,609 --> 00:40:48,609
that are stuck together.

1058
00:40:49,349 --> 00:40:54,749
(The sea squirt bunches that haven't been separated)

1059
00:40:54,749 --> 00:40:55,919
(The sea squirts are moved backward.)

1060
00:40:55,919 --> 00:40:57,749
Oh, we can just push them back when they're still stuck together.

1061
00:40:57,749 --> 00:40:59,159
(The sea squirts are moved backward.)

1062
00:40:59,259 --> 00:41:01,459
We're backed up with work because of these clumps.

1063
00:41:01,459 --> 00:41:03,459
Our work is piling up.

1064
00:41:03,459 --> 00:41:04,689
(They need to move their hands more quickly.)

1065
00:41:05,299 --> 00:41:09,429
(On top of that, a 1.8-ton batch of sea squirts is added.)

1066
00:41:10,069 --> 00:41:13,569
(They separate the sea squirts non-stop as they keep pouring in.)

1067
00:41:13,569 --> 00:41:14,839
(Sea squirts are moved backward.)

1068
00:41:14,839 --> 00:41:15,939
We're so backed up.

1069
00:41:17,669 --> 00:41:19,739
- Oh, no. What do we do?
- My goodness.

1070
00:41:19,739 --> 00:41:21,509
We're falling behind. We need to pick up the pace.

1071
00:41:22,479 --> 00:41:23,849
Oh, no. This is bad.

1072
00:41:23,879 --> 00:41:26,019
- This is bad. We're in trouble.
- We really need to move faster.

1073
00:41:26,579 --> 00:41:27,579
What do we do?

1074
00:41:27,579 --> 00:41:29,649
(As sea squirts keep pouring in from both sides...)

1075
00:41:29,649 --> 00:41:30,719
(Screaming)

1076
00:41:31,959 --> 00:41:34,189
Hold on. Hang on a second.

1077
00:41:34,189 --> 00:41:37,759
(Captain Yum goes out of control.)

1078
00:41:38,799 --> 00:41:40,659
Jung Ah, we should move faster. Hold on a second.

1079
00:41:40,929 --> 00:41:42,199
I'm working as quickly as possible.

1080
00:41:47,199 --> 00:41:50,769
(The youngest members seem relatively relaxed.)

1081
00:41:50,769 --> 00:41:52,409
It looks like a chicken drumstick.

1082
00:41:53,039 --> 00:41:55,649
Now that you said that, it does look like a drumstick.

1083
00:41:56,649 --> 00:41:59,819
Most young people don't like sea squirts.

1084
00:41:59,819 --> 00:42:01,889
They have a strong scent of the ocean.

1085
00:42:02,219 --> 00:42:04,219
You should eat this if you want nice skin.

1086
00:42:04,219 --> 00:42:06,389
- Does it help to get nice skin?
- That's why you have nice skin.

1087
00:42:07,419 --> 00:42:09,129
I'm 80 years old.

1088
00:42:09,129 --> 00:42:10,629
Really? You're 80 years old?

1089
00:42:10,629 --> 00:42:12,759
I thought you were in your 50s.

1090
00:42:16,769 --> 00:42:18,999
You have a way with words, You Seok.

1091
00:42:18,999 --> 00:42:20,999
She really looks much younger than her age.

1092
00:42:20,999 --> 00:42:22,069
(He's socially savvy.)

1093
00:42:22,709 --> 00:42:24,169
I look like I'm 100 years old without a mask.

1094
00:42:24,409 --> 00:42:25,579
- No way.
- I look like I'm 100.

1095
00:42:25,579 --> 00:42:27,709
(He has a nice chat with the lady with a baby face.)

1096
00:42:28,479 --> 00:42:31,479
- This feels like a video game.
- Exactly.

1097
00:42:31,479 --> 00:42:33,249
- Like the carp bread tycoon game.
- Right.

1098
00:42:33,249 --> 00:42:34,879
(The youngest members are in full gamer mode.)

1099
00:42:35,689 --> 00:42:36,789
(Peeking)

1100
00:42:36,789 --> 00:42:37,789
You see...

1101
00:42:38,289 --> 00:42:39,959
Jung Ah and Sun Young seem so exhausted.

1102
00:42:41,519 --> 00:42:42,689
- We're falling behind again.
- Guys.

1103
00:42:43,059 --> 00:42:44,129
- We're falling behind again.
- Is it going well?

1104
00:42:44,129 --> 00:42:45,429
What? Well, we... Yes.

1105
00:42:46,059 --> 00:42:47,129
- We're falling behind again.
- Is it going well?

1106
00:42:47,129 --> 00:42:48,699
(She stammers out a yes.)

1107
00:42:48,699 --> 00:42:50,969
- Is it going well?
- It's chaotic here.

1108
00:42:52,239 --> 00:42:54,599
We keep getting the sea squirts sent back.

1109
00:42:55,909 --> 00:42:57,169
(Walking slowly)

1110
00:42:58,139 --> 00:42:59,509
- Do you need help?
- Sorry?

1111
00:43:00,639 --> 00:43:01,809
(Worried about the older members, You Seok steps in to help.)

1112
00:43:01,809 --> 00:43:03,149
I have to remove things like this and toss it, right?

1113
00:43:03,149 --> 00:43:04,349
That's right. That's what you should do.

1114
00:43:04,679 --> 00:43:07,419
You have to check the sea squirts thoroughly.

1115
00:43:07,719 --> 00:43:10,019
We kept getting the sea squirts sent back.

1116
00:43:11,189 --> 00:43:13,359
(The three of them work hard checking the sea squirts.)

1117
00:43:13,619 --> 00:43:14,989
This is much harder than what I did over there.

1118
00:43:16,329 --> 00:43:17,389
They're flooding in.

1119
00:43:18,489 --> 00:43:20,229
(Sea squirt)

1120
00:43:20,459 --> 00:43:21,699
(Sea squirt)

1121
00:43:23,469 --> 00:43:25,399
Ma'am, you have amazing concentration.

1122
00:43:25,669 --> 00:43:28,939
- I've been doing this for 30 years.
- Yes?

1123
00:43:28,939 --> 00:43:30,139
- Thirty years?
- Yes.

1124
00:43:30,139 --> 00:43:31,939
(Surprised)

1125
00:43:31,939 --> 00:43:33,879
You've been doing this for 30 years?

1126
00:43:33,879 --> 00:43:35,009
(The lady is a veteran worker with 30 years of experience.)

1127
00:43:35,009 --> 00:43:36,709
Oh, I'm working with a master.

1128
00:43:37,209 --> 00:43:39,849
That's why you're so skillful.

1129
00:43:42,019 --> 00:43:43,019
Stop. Oh, no.

1130
00:43:43,019 --> 00:43:44,549
(I'll do my best too.)

1131
00:43:44,549 --> 00:43:45,789
(Beeping)

1132
00:43:47,319 --> 00:43:49,289
(The sea squirt basket is full.)

1133
00:43:49,989 --> 00:43:54,329
(She meticulously picks up the sea squirts which fell out.)

1134
00:43:54,799 --> 00:43:56,229
(Careful not to topple it over)

1135
00:43:58,099 --> 00:43:59,139
Let's go.

1136
00:44:01,539 --> 00:44:03,539
(She puts the heavy basket in its place.)

1137
00:44:05,539 --> 00:44:07,409
(Thanks to Yoon Seo, the basket starts to fill up again.)

1138
00:44:08,679 --> 00:44:10,449
(She spots something.)

1139
00:44:11,249 --> 00:44:12,979
More and more sea squirts are coming up.

1140
00:44:14,219 --> 00:44:15,889
They're rushing in.

1141
00:44:15,889 --> 00:44:17,219
(More sea squirts rush in.)

1142
00:44:17,219 --> 00:44:18,219
They're coming.

1143
00:44:18,959 --> 00:44:21,259
(Bottomless refill of sea squirts)

1144
00:44:22,189 --> 00:44:24,159
(They move their hands nonstop as they focus on sorting them out.)

1145
00:44:27,059 --> 00:44:28,969
Let's go peel sea squirts.

1146
00:44:28,969 --> 00:44:30,999
- What did you say?
- What was it?

1147
00:44:30,999 --> 00:44:32,139
We need to go peel sea squirts.

1148
00:44:32,139 --> 00:44:33,839
- Peel them?
- Yes.

1149
00:44:34,299 --> 00:44:38,879
(This wasn't the end of the task?)

1150
00:44:39,055 --> 00:44:40,755
- What was it?
- We need to go peel sea squirts.

1151
00:44:40,755 --> 00:44:42,595
- Peel them?
- Yes.

1152
00:44:42,995 --> 00:44:47,865
(This wasn't the end of the task?)

1153
00:44:48,635 --> 00:44:52,205
(The sorting facility they're working at)

1154
00:44:52,605 --> 00:44:54,705
(Next to the sorting area,)

1155
00:44:54,875 --> 00:44:56,905
(there's another workspace.)

1156
00:44:57,505 --> 00:45:00,945
(The job doesn't end with sorting them.)

1157
00:45:03,745 --> 00:45:09,685
(Pour out the whole basket of sea squirts.)

1158
00:45:10,225 --> 00:45:14,525
(It's time to peel them.)

1159
00:45:15,195 --> 00:45:18,265
(Peeling sea squirts is the final part of the labor.)

1160
00:45:18,695 --> 00:45:19,765
Let's go.

1161
00:45:20,695 --> 00:45:22,705
(After sorting the sea squirts, they're dragged without resistance.)

1162
00:45:22,965 --> 00:45:24,765
Let's cut it together.

1163
00:45:24,765 --> 00:45:26,105
How do I peel it?

1164
00:45:26,405 --> 00:45:29,505
The two things over here are the sea squirt's nose.

1165
00:45:30,275 --> 00:45:32,845
(Step 1. Find the sea squirt's nose.)

1166
00:45:34,215 --> 00:45:35,915
Cut it like this.

1167
00:45:35,915 --> 00:45:36,915
(Step 2. Cut its nose.)

1168
00:45:38,145 --> 00:45:41,215
(Cut right at the nose.)

1169
00:45:41,715 --> 00:45:45,185
You'll see its feces, the poo.

1170
00:45:45,185 --> 00:45:48,095
(Sea squirt's poo)

1171
00:45:48,195 --> 00:45:49,565
You need to remove it.

1172
00:45:50,025 --> 00:45:54,595
(Step 3. Remove the sea squirt's poo.)

1173
00:45:55,905 --> 00:45:59,335
(Sea squirt's poo)

1174
00:45:59,335 --> 00:46:02,305
Just score it, and it'll be removed when it's washed.

1175
00:46:02,305 --> 00:46:04,305
(Just score it, and it'll be removed when it's washed.)

1176
00:46:05,045 --> 00:46:07,875
- This poo.
- Yes. You need to remove the poo.

1177
00:46:09,585 --> 00:46:10,915
- I removed it.
- Good.

1178
00:46:14,755 --> 00:46:18,585
(Step 4. Put it into the container, and it's done.)

1179
00:46:19,155 --> 00:46:20,325
Okay.

1180
00:46:21,225 --> 00:46:23,195
- Like this.
- Score here.

1181
00:46:23,525 --> 00:46:24,965
Remove the sea squirt poo.

1182
00:46:24,965 --> 00:46:25,965
This one.

1183
00:46:25,965 --> 00:46:27,365
- That's right.
- Okay.

1184
00:46:28,135 --> 00:46:29,135
I got the hang of it.

1185
00:46:30,905 --> 00:46:33,235
(Captain Yum cranes her neck to stare at the sea squirt.)

1186
00:46:33,475 --> 00:46:35,405
(Very focused)

1187
00:46:37,405 --> 00:46:41,915
(She cuts its nose with precision,)

1188
00:46:42,415 --> 00:46:45,955
(and as she was taught, she takes it out...)

1189
00:46:47,285 --> 00:46:50,685
(and diligently removes its poo.)

1190
00:46:51,255 --> 00:46:54,125
- Is it here? It's here, right?
- That's right.

1191
00:46:54,125 --> 00:46:55,325
Yes, that's right.

1192
00:46:56,295 --> 00:46:57,765
(Fascinated by her first experience of peeling a sea squirt)

1193
00:46:57,765 --> 00:46:59,735
It gushes out when I cut it.

1194
00:47:00,265 --> 00:47:01,665
This is cathartic.

1195
00:47:02,505 --> 00:47:03,505
- What?
- Cathartic.

1196
00:47:05,535 --> 00:47:07,375
(Humming)

1197
00:47:09,545 --> 00:47:11,305
(He got curious while peeling the sea squirts.)

1198
00:47:11,305 --> 00:47:14,245
How do people eat this? As raw fish?

1199
00:47:14,345 --> 00:47:16,245
- Raw fish over rice?
- The old lady told me earlier...

1200
00:47:16,245 --> 00:47:17,585
that they have it as sea squirt bibimbap.

1201
00:47:17,585 --> 00:47:18,615
Yes.

1202
00:47:18,615 --> 00:47:20,015
- Sea squirt...
- Sea squirt bibimbap.

1203
00:47:20,015 --> 00:47:23,025
- We eat it raw too. With chojang.
- As raw fish?

1204
00:47:24,185 --> 00:47:25,895
(Is Yoon Seo doing okay?)

1205
00:47:28,525 --> 00:47:30,795
(Pretty skilled)

1206
00:47:32,065 --> 00:47:33,395
I got the hang of it now.

1207
00:47:34,195 --> 00:47:35,565
(Learning completed)

1208
00:47:36,265 --> 00:47:37,465
- Did you, Yoon Seo?
- Yes.

1209
00:47:37,465 --> 00:47:39,705
But I can't match up to the boss' speed.

1210
00:47:40,075 --> 00:47:41,575
(Laughing)

1211
00:47:41,575 --> 00:47:42,645
- Can I watch?
- Yes.

1212
00:47:49,185 --> 00:47:50,645
(3 seconds only)

1213
00:47:50,885 --> 00:47:51,945
(Jaw dropped)

1214
00:47:51,945 --> 00:47:52,985
That took her three seconds.

1215
00:47:53,515 --> 00:47:55,725
It would be over very soon if we worked at her speed.

1216
00:47:57,325 --> 00:47:59,595
(Deeply moved)

1217
00:48:00,825 --> 00:48:06,195
(Motivated by the demonstration, she peels diligently.)

1218
00:48:06,565 --> 00:48:08,965
(Skilled)

1219
00:48:09,305 --> 00:48:11,065
I can now see where the poo is located.

1220
00:48:11,965 --> 00:48:15,175
Just score it, and it'll be removed during the wash.

1221
00:48:15,175 --> 00:48:19,545
(Yoon Seo has adapted to it perfectly.)

1222
00:48:20,115 --> 00:48:24,215
(Skilled mode activated)

1223
00:48:24,645 --> 00:48:29,685
(Yoon Seo's container gets filled up quickly.)

1224
00:48:30,385 --> 00:48:32,625
(It's already almost full.)

1225
00:48:33,695 --> 00:48:35,325
- You're fast.
- I did a lot, didn't I?

1226
00:48:35,325 --> 00:48:36,495
Did the boss help you?

1227
00:48:36,495 --> 00:48:38,065
- Why do you have so many?
- No, she didn't.

1228
00:48:38,365 --> 00:48:39,865
You peeled a lot.

1229
00:48:39,865 --> 00:48:41,335
- She didn't help me.
- Yoon Seo peeled a lot.

1230
00:48:41,335 --> 00:48:42,535
You're good.

1231
00:48:42,535 --> 00:48:44,835
- I am, aren't I?
- You're talented.

1232
00:48:44,835 --> 00:48:45,835
(Proud of herself)

1233
00:48:46,035 --> 00:48:47,835
You've been doing well since just now.

1234
00:48:48,805 --> 00:48:50,345
It looks like she's good with her hands, no matter the task.

1235
00:48:51,475 --> 00:48:54,015
(Bopping to the compliment)

1236
00:48:54,545 --> 00:48:58,685
(1 box completed so far)

1237
00:48:59,085 --> 00:49:03,255
(Here are additional sea squirts.)

1238
00:49:03,855 --> 00:49:06,055
(The fight against sea squirts is ongoing.)

1239
00:49:07,325 --> 00:49:09,595
(Hunched neck)

1240
00:49:10,195 --> 00:49:12,495
(Stiff shoulders)

1241
00:49:12,965 --> 00:49:17,105
(The whole body aches from working with their necks bent.)

1242
00:49:18,005 --> 00:49:19,305
Your neck hurts from this.

1243
00:49:20,135 --> 00:49:21,805
(He stretches when he hears that.)

1244
00:49:21,805 --> 00:49:24,075
- Because you have your neck bent.
- Your back too.

1245
00:49:24,175 --> 00:49:25,475
- Straighten your back.
- You must be too focused on...

1246
00:49:25,475 --> 00:49:26,745
finding the poo.

1247
00:49:26,745 --> 00:49:28,345
- Yes.
- Staying standing is hard.

1248
00:49:29,215 --> 00:49:31,115
- Oh, no. Get a chair.
- Don't your feet hurt?

1249
00:49:31,885 --> 00:49:33,885
I'm always standing at home too.

1250
00:49:34,085 --> 00:49:35,585
I see.

1251
00:49:36,425 --> 00:49:37,855
- You don't stand much, do you?
- No.

1252
00:49:38,455 --> 00:49:40,655
- I'm normally laid down.
- Would you like to sit and work?

1253
00:49:41,495 --> 00:49:43,595
I'm sorry I'm the only one sitting down.

1254
00:49:44,225 --> 00:49:46,695
- If it hurts, you should sit.
- Yes. You should sit and work.

1255
00:49:47,695 --> 00:49:48,765
Aren't you tired, Jung Ah?

1256
00:49:50,365 --> 00:49:51,635
I'm used to this.

1257
00:49:52,705 --> 00:49:54,475
I do this even at home.

1258
00:49:56,145 --> 00:49:59,215
You're amazing. So cool.

1259
00:49:59,945 --> 00:50:02,385
- Stand more on a regular basis.
- I will.

1260
00:50:02,915 --> 00:50:05,015
I shall do that from now on.

1261
00:50:05,915 --> 00:50:06,985
Poo.

1262
00:50:07,715 --> 00:50:08,715
- Sir.
- Yes.

1263
00:50:08,715 --> 00:50:09,755
I'm too tired.

1264
00:50:09,855 --> 00:50:12,925
I'll pay you half the rate since you sat down.

1265
00:50:13,695 --> 00:50:15,095
We need 200 dollars to eat out.

1266
00:50:16,095 --> 00:50:18,525
I've been watching you, and all you do is talk and not work.

