2283
01:28:55,415 --> 01:28:57,645
I definitely had no strength left.

2284
01:28:57,985 --> 01:29:02,015
But the instant I saw her face, I suddenly found strength.

2285
01:29:03,015 --> 01:29:04,485
Then the knife went in.

2286
01:29:04,885 --> 01:29:06,825
She's an amazing person.

2287
01:29:08,995 --> 01:29:10,325
That's so funny.

2288
01:29:10,325 --> 01:29:12,095
(She may not be resourceful, but she's quick with her hands.)

2289
01:29:12,965 --> 01:29:14,095
(She calms down and focuses on slicing the radish.)

2290
01:29:14,095 --> 01:29:16,335
Is radish the best in autumn?

2291
01:29:16,735 --> 01:29:18,565
This is not what Jung Ah likes.

2292
01:29:18,865 --> 01:29:20,465
This is not what Jung Ah likes.

2293
01:29:20,465 --> 01:29:21,605
(The radish is cut too straight.)

2294
01:29:22,675 --> 01:29:24,135
(Cutting)

2295
01:29:24,705 --> 01:29:25,975
