2296
01:29:25,975 --> 01:29:27,445
I have to shape it like this.

2297
01:29:27,445 --> 01:29:29,045
(She starts shaping it the way Jung Ah likes.)

2298
01:29:29,245 --> 01:29:30,245
(Eating)

2299
01:29:30,245 --> 01:29:33,115
