2386
01:33:09,665 --> 01:33:11,035
I think...

2387
01:33:11,035 --> 01:33:12,805
either this or this.

2388
01:33:12,805 --> 01:33:13,965
Is this prettier?

2389
01:33:13,965 --> 01:33:15,435
Which one do you prefer?

2390
01:33:15,835 --> 01:33:16,935
Here.

2391
01:33:18,645 --> 01:33:21,345
(She puts just enough kimchi for them to eat today...)

2392
01:33:21,345 --> 01:33:24,215
(onto the plate chosen by the youngest.)

2393
01:33:25,515 --> 01:33:27,685
(She puts the remaining kimchi into a kimchi container.)

2394
01:33:28,485 --> 01:33:31,255
(It will be in charge of their breakfast the next day.)

2395
01:33:32,155 --> 01:33:34,585
(Meanwhile...)

2396
01:33:35,095 --> 01:33:36,195
