2399
01:33:41,835 --> 01:33:43,635
(She washes them immediately.)

2400
01:33:44,635 --> 01:33:46,605
You must clean up as you go.

2401
01:33:47,405 --> 01:33:48,675
That's how you can sleep early.

2402
01:33:50,135 --> 01:33:52,745
