2407
01:34:05,485 --> 01:34:07,955
We should recycle, right?

2408
01:34:09,355 --> 01:34:11,225
(Neat)

2409
01:34:13,395 --> 01:34:16,195
Sun Young is a lot faster...

2410
01:34:16,365 --> 01:34:19,165
and better at her tasks than I thought.

2411
01:34:19,435 --> 01:34:21,535
- She's super fast.
- She's very fast.

2412
01:34:22,235 --> 01:34:24,575
(I'll just do a third of this.)

2413
01:34:24,575 --> 01:34:25,805
(Okay.)

2414
01:34:26,605 --> 01:34:31,275
(She washes the ingredients without being asked.)

2415
01:34:32,485 --> 01:34:34,585
(But she's not exactly thorough.)

2416
01:34:35,115 --> 01:34:39,755
(She cuts fast too.)

2417
01:34:40,055 --> 01:34:41,555
(I should clean up.)

2418
01:34:42,055 --> 01:34:43,995
(She works nonstop.)

2419
01:34:43,995 --> 01:34:46,525
(A wasp at work, Sun Young)

2420
01:34:48,365 --> 01:34:51,535
(She's even dressed like a wasp.)

2421
01:34:51,905 --> 01:34:53,065
(Because of Sun Young,)

2422
01:34:53,065 --> 01:34:54,975
(I got a lot faster too.)

2423
01:34:55,675 --> 01:34:59,545
(Wasp Sun Young makes impatient Jung Ah rush even more.)

2424
01:35:00,075 --> 01:35:02,915
(Look forward to Wasp Sun Young.)

2425
01:35:03,975 --> 01:35:05,715
- You Seok, start the fire.
- Okay.

2426
01:35:06,745 --> 01:35:08,585
