2456
01:36:24,655 --> 01:36:26,425
(Struggling)

2457
01:36:27,295 --> 01:36:30,335
(Unaware of the reason, he showers in the smoke.)

2458
01:36:30,635 --> 01:36:31,665
My eyes sting.

2459
01:36:31,665 --> 01:36:32,765
(Save You Seok.)

2460
01:36:33,765 --> 01:36:36,735
(The first harsh side of the show makes him dizzy.)

2461
01:36:37,105 --> 01:36:38,205
My eyes sting.

2462
01:36:38,605 --> 01:36:41,475
(This won't do.)

2463
01:36:44,445 --> 01:36:46,415
(Sunglasses on)

2464
01:36:47,145 --> 01:36:52,285
(He wears a glasses shield and tries again.)

2465
01:36:54,585 --> 01:36:55,595
(Defense power 0.1)

2466
01:36:58,295 --> 01:37:00,565
(Sizzling)

2467
01:37:01,195 --> 01:37:03,835
(Please grill well.)

2468
01:37:04,135 --> 01:37:06,205
(Recoiling)

2469
01:37:08,675 --> 01:37:11,035
(A drop of tear...)

2470
01:37:11,035 --> 01:37:12,045
(for a piece of pork belly)

2471
01:37:12,045 --> 01:37:13,175
I'm so sad.

2472
01:37:14,545 --> 01:37:18,345
(He fights with the smoke and tries to avoid it.)

2473
01:37:18,985 --> 01:37:21,955
(He's met with a harsh welcome.)

2474
01:37:25,325 --> 01:37:26,555
Why am I the only one with stinging eyes?

2475
01:37:26,555 --> 01:37:27,585
(Confused)

2476
01:37:28,425 --> 01:37:29,425
Are you okay?

2477
01:37:30,325 --> 01:37:31,925
You don't look okay, but are you okay?

2478
01:37:32,125 --> 01:37:33,225
I'm okay.

2479
01:37:33,225 --> 01:37:34,565
(I'm okay.)

2480
01:37:34,765 --> 01:37:36,565
(Laughing awkwardly)

2481
01:37:36,895 --> 01:37:39,835
(He pulls himself together and goes back to grilling.)

2482
01:37:40,665 --> 01:37:42,375
(Thanks to You Seok fighting through tears,)

2483
01:37:42,375 --> 01:37:44,105
(thin-sliced pork belly is being grilled nicely.)

2484
01:37:44,575 --> 01:37:47,645
(The meat warrior fights against the smoke.)

2485
01:37:48,475 --> 01:37:50,415
(Meanwhile, Sun Young is taking out some sea squirts to grill.)

2486
01:37:50,415 --> 01:37:52,045
That's enough.

2487
01:37:53,585 --> 01:37:56,585
(Wash the sea squirts in water before grilling.)

2488
01:37:57,015 --> 01:37:59,585
I'll put them in a strainer...

2489
01:37:59,585 --> 01:38:01,055
(Ready to deliver with the water drained out)

2490
01:38:01,055 --> 01:38:02,195
