2494
01:38:12,105 --> 01:38:13,505
It's so good.

2495
01:38:13,505 --> 01:38:15,435
- Isn't it hot?
- Not at all.

2496
01:38:15,435 --> 01:38:16,635
(Feeling proud)

2497
01:38:17,305 --> 01:38:23,515
(He puts the well-grilled pork belly onto a plate.)

2498
01:38:24,415 --> 01:38:26,885
The oil would splatter like crazy.

2499
01:38:27,385 --> 01:38:30,685
(Sea squirt, let's get you an oil shower.)

2500
01:38:31,415 --> 01:38:33,585
(Cautious)

2501
01:38:33,585 --> 01:38:35,225
(Startled)

2502
01:38:36,125 --> 01:38:39,795
(He had collected pork belly oil to grill sea squirts.)

2503
01:38:40,625 --> 01:38:44,935
(He quickly adds all the sea squirts to avoid the oil splatter.)

2504
01:38:45,965 --> 01:38:50,075
(How will sea squirts taste when grilled using pork belly oil?)

2505
01:38:50,075 --> 01:38:53,145
They look like tripe when grilled.

2506
01:38:55,215 --> 01:38:59,215
(Sea squirts are getting cooked coated in savory pork belly oil.)

2507
01:39:00,215 --> 01:39:03,755
(Once they're cooked, take them out onto a plate before they get tough.)

2508
01:39:05,115 --> 01:39:06,155
I'm curious.

2509
01:39:07,155 --> 01:39:08,555
It smells so good.

2510
01:39:10,095 --> 01:39:11,495
(They blend in nicely with savory pork belly oil.)

2511
01:39:11,495 --> 01:39:12,725
This is so fascinating.

2512
01:39:12,725 --> 01:39:16,265
(The sea flavor has become even richer.)

2513
01:39:16,265 --> 01:39:17,495
I want to try.

2514
01:39:17,495 --> 01:39:19,665
(Swallowing her saliva)

2515
01:39:19,665 --> 01:39:22,135
- Don't they look like tripe?
- Yes. They look so tasty.

2516
01:39:23,135 --> 01:39:25,505
(I can't hold myself back.)

2517
01:39:26,645 --> 01:39:29,045
(She blows it and takes a bite.)

2518
01:39:31,655 --> 01:39:34,125
(I can't hold myself back.)

2519
01:39:35,125 --> 01:39:37,565
(She blows it and takes a bite.)

2520
01:39:40,065 --> 01:39:41,065
Come here.

2521
01:39:42,835 --> 01:39:46,035
(How does sea squirt grilled in pork belly oil taste?)

2522
01:39:46,735 --> 01:39:47,775
It's delicious.

2523
01:39:48,675 --> 01:39:51,405
It has the texture of tripe.

2524
01:39:51,405 --> 01:39:52,645
(This feels like tripe!)

2525
01:39:52,645 --> 01:39:53,815
It's delicious.

2526
01:39:54,315 --> 01:39:56,945
I find this better than the raw one.

2527
01:39:56,945 --> 01:39:58,045
(It tastes better than raw sea squirt.)

2528
01:39:58,045 --> 01:40:00,485
I should check if the potatoes are cooked.

2529
01:40:00,485 --> 01:40:01,785
You haven't added them yet, right?

2530
01:40:01,785 --> 01:40:03,655
- Doenjang? I've added it.
- Sea squirts.

2531
01:40:03,655 --> 01:40:05,385
I'll put them last.

2532
01:40:06,525 --> 01:40:08,155
(Boiling doenjang jjigae as the broth)

2533
01:40:08,825 --> 01:40:10,525
(She adds some minced garlic.)

2534
01:40:12,125 --> 01:40:14,795
(And anchovy sauce?)

