01:50:47,435 --> 01:50:48,795
You acted like you would tell us.

2774
01:50:49,265 --> 01:50:50,665
Gosh. They won't tell us?

2775
01:50:51,535 --> 01:50:53,505
Still, leaving at 11am sounds good to me.

2776
01:50:53,905 --> 01:50:56,445
Just tell us this one thing. Will we be on a boat or on land?

2777
01:50:57,345 --> 01:50:58,375
They won't tell us that either.

2778
01:50:58,605 --> 01:51:00,975
I'm sure we won't go out to sea. We headed out on a boat twice today.

2779
01:51:01,475 --> 01:51:02,575
Tomorrow will be our third time on a boat.

2780
01:51:03,615 --> 01:51:05,545
It won't be fun to watch us on a boat all the time.

2781
01:51:05,545 --> 01:51:07,155
- The viewers will get bored.
- We'll be on a boat twice a day.

2782
01:51:07,955 --> 01:51:09,015
(Tomorrow's labor remains a mystery.)

2783
01:51:09,015 --> 01:51:10,125
So you won't tell us until tomorrow?

2784
01:51:10,125 --> 01:51:11,125
(Tomorrow's work remains a mystery.)

2785
01:51:11,899 --> 01:51:14,139
(Today is going to be a real grind.)

2786
01:51:14,365 --> 01:51:15,635
(Give it your all, like your life depends on it.)

2787
01:51:15,965 --> 01:51:17,435
(Like my life depends on it?)

2788
01:51:17,435 --> 01:51:18,435
(Screaming)

2789
01:51:19,135 --> 01:51:20,135
(Screams break out everywhere.)

2790
01:51:20,275 --> 01:51:21,475
(Imagine we're at an OB-GYN.)

2791
01:51:21,805 --> 01:51:23,545
(The work is as tough as labor pains?)

2792
01:51:24,145 --> 01:51:25,805
(The youngest members get frightened too.)

2793
01:51:26,145 --> 01:51:27,345
(It means you won't get paid if you keep going like this.)

2794
01:51:27,415 --> 01:51:28,645
(Even their best effort isn't enough to earn their keep.)

2795
01:51:28,645 --> 01:51:29,785
(Even their best effort isn't enough to earn their keep.)

2796
01:51:30,945 --> 01:51:32,015
(Help!)

2797
01:51:32,715 --> 01:51:35,455
(It all happens in the deep sea.)

2798
01:51:35,985 --> 01:51:38,525
(What could be the job that frightened the four members?)

2799
01:51:38,955 --> 01:51:41,995
(Right then, suspicious person approaches them.)

2800
01:51:42,155 --> 01:51:44,525
(I told you not to take the boat out!)

2801
01:51:44,625 --> 01:51:46,635
(He scolds the four members?)

2802
01:51:46,995 --> 01:51:49,505
(Eun Myeong, Daddy is here!)

2803
01:51:49,505 --> 01:51:51,435
(The 1st guest in Season 3, Actor Park Hae Joon)

2804
01:51:52,105 --> 01:51:54,905
(You're here, Father.)

2805
01:51:55,175 --> 01:51:56,845
(He's Hae Joon, just as I thought.)

2806
01:51:57,075 --> 01:51:58,075
(Why didn't you get on the boat?)

2807
01:51:58,245 --> 01:51:59,775
(You must work, Hae Joon.)

2808
01:52:00,845 --> 01:52:02,215
(I stayed to work even harder later.)

2809
01:52:03,245 --> 01:52:04,485
(Meticulous)

2810
01:52:04,645 --> 01:52:06,255
(It turns out he's good at hard labor?)

2811
01:52:06,955 --> 01:52:08,255
(He's a good dancer too?)

2812
01:52:08,585 --> 01:52:10,225
(What is up with him?)

2813
01:52:10,485 --> 01:52:11,685
(I'm a shy, middle-aged man.)

2814
01:52:12,425 --> 01:52:15,555
(He becomes an excited man around the siblings.)

2815
01:52:15,895 --> 01:52:17,865
(He turns out to have a lot of lively energy.)

2816
01:52:18,260 --> 01:52:20,693
(I guess I'm a fool)

2817
01:52:22,169 --> 01:52:23,439
(You Seok's playful performance...)

2818
01:52:23,439 --> 01:52:24,699
(that cracked the older members up will be revealed as well.)

2819
01:52:25,099 --> 01:52:26,909
(Stop filming! I said, stop filming!)

2820
01:52:27,739 --> 01:52:29,839
(Their happiness didn't last long.)

2821
01:52:29,936 --> 01:52:30,936
(What are you trying to do?)

2822
01:52:31,169 --> 01:52:32,769
(Have we done something wrong?)

2823
01:52:33,013 --> 01:52:34,573
(The siblings got terrified.)

2824
01:52:35,043 --> 01:52:37,983
(What threw the siblings into a panic?)
